WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.303 --> 00:00:05.738
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:07.106
President Biden visited

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:10.809
an Amtrak maintenance facility
today in Delaware.

00:00:10.809 --> 00:00:13.146
So we got an extra hour
of sleep this weekend,

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:16.149
but he sure didn't.
"I'm too excited."

00:00:18.784 --> 00:00:21.520
Former President Trump
took the witness stand today

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:24.257
in his civil fraud trial.
He swore to tell the truth,

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:26.159
the whole truth and nothing
but the truth,

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:28.862
and then everyone
just laughed and laughed.

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:33.366
While testifying during his
civil fraud trial today,

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:34.633
former President Trump said

00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:36.302
that he believes
his Mar-a-Lago resort

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:39.672
is worth between
$1 billion and $1.5 billion.

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:42.007
Oh. Very smart.

00:00:42.007 --> 00:00:44.910
The insanity defense.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:48.347
Dude, you bought it
for $10,000,000 in 1985,

00:00:48.347 --> 00:00:51.251
and now it's worth 1.5 billion?

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:55.855
The only way I would believe
that is if it was in Brooklyn.

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:59.392
Then that's about right.
Maybe a little low.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:00.626
While testifying today,

00:01:00.626 --> 00:01:02.461
former President Trump
also appeared to forget

00:01:02.461 --> 00:01:04.797
that he wasn't president
in 2021.

00:01:04.797 --> 00:01:09.169
Well, so did half the country.

00:01:09.169 --> 00:01:11.404
After FBI agents raided the home

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.339
of his chief fundraiser
last week,

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:16.175
New York Mayor Eric Adams said,
quote,

00:01:16.175 --> 00:01:18.644
"Where there's smoke,
there's not always fire."

00:01:18.644 --> 00:01:23.649
Ah, yes,
that famous expression.

00:01:23.649 --> 00:01:25.617
Okay, so we found out
he's shady.

00:01:25.617 --> 00:01:29.222
But you know what they say --
late is worse than never.

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:36.262
The third Republican
presidential primary debate

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:38.864
will be held Wednesday in Miami
or, as it's now dubbed,

00:01:38.864 --> 00:01:42.968
"Who Wants to Be
a Vice President?"

00:01:42.968 --> 00:01:44.704
Pennsylvania Senator
John Fetterman

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:47.240
criticized California Governor
Gavin Newsom over the weekend

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:49.175
and said he was secretly
running for president,

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:50.543
as opposed to Fetterman,

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:51.744
who looks like
he's running for

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:54.747
guy who doesn't wipe down
the equipment at the gym.

00:01:57.783 --> 00:02:01.053
Meta CEO Mark Zuckerberg
revealed on Friday

00:02:01.053 --> 00:02:02.989
that he tore his ACL
while training

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:04.857
for a competitive MMA fight.

00:02:04.857 --> 00:02:06.726
Apparently,
what happened was

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:09.362
there was a coffee table
in the way.

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:17.437
The fastest runner in
the New York City Marathon

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:18.738
yesterday
finished the course

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:20.606
in just under two hours
and five minutes,

00:02:20.606 --> 00:02:26.512
a full ten minutes faster
than if he had taken the bus.

00:02:26.512 --> 00:02:31.116
Better luck next year, the bus.

00:02:31.116 --> 00:02:33.486
Archeologists in Germany believe
they've discovered

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:36.121
the ancient remains
of a husband and wife

00:02:36.121 --> 00:02:38.124
buried in the same casket.

00:02:38.124 --> 00:02:39.559
Her idea.

00:02:41.527 --> 00:02:43.830
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.997 --> 00:02:46.633
Baz!

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:52.038
We're going to win them back
with this one.

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:55.274
And finally, the American
Ornithological -- Ornith--

00:02:55.274 --> 00:02:57.076
Oh, Jesus.

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:58.844
I said this word wrong
last week,

00:02:58.844 --> 00:03:01.948
and I got a lot of angry notes
from ornithologists.

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:05.785
And now I'm in my head about it.

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:08.254
And finally, the American
Bird People Society

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:09.955
announced --
It's fine.

00:03:09.955 --> 00:03:15.795
It's an either/or.
It's famously an either/or.

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:18.531
Announced last week that it
is renaming birds

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:21.100
that are currently named
after problematic people,

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:23.202
though in retrospect,
it was never really fair

00:03:23.202 --> 00:03:24.203
to name that one

00:03:24.203 --> 00:03:26.306
Jared from Subway.

00:03:26.306 --> 00:03:28.841
Former president Trump
testified yesterday

00:03:28.841 --> 00:03:30.409
at his civil fraud trial

00:03:30.409 --> 00:03:33.145
and spent nearly four hours
on the witness stand.

00:03:33.145 --> 00:03:34.681
But the judge
had to call it a day

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:37.483
before they could ask him
a third question.

00:03:37.483 --> 00:03:38.985
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:41.387
During his testimony yesterday,
former president Trump

00:03:41.387 --> 00:03:43.990
pulled a piece of paper
out of his suit jacket

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.691
that he claimed
would clear his name,

00:03:45.691 --> 00:03:47.760
but the judge would not
let him read it

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.630
'cause, as usual,
it was classified.

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:52.264
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.264 --> 00:03:53.799
That's right,
during his civil fraud trial,

00:03:53.799 --> 00:03:56.001
Trump pulled a piece of paper
out of his suit jacket

00:03:56.001 --> 00:03:57.737
and said it would
completely clear his name.

00:03:57.737 --> 00:03:59.839
Dude, you couldn't have
cleared your name

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:03.976
if you'd pulled out a neuralyzer
from "Men in Black."

00:04:03.976 --> 00:04:06.813
What piece of paper
could possibly clear your name?

00:04:06.813 --> 00:04:10.550
Was it a birth certificate
with a different name?

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:12.585
[ As Trump ] Your Honor,
this clears my name because,

00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:16.521
as you can see,
my name is Reginald Periwinkle.

00:04:16.521 --> 00:04:19.825
You've got the wrong guy.

00:04:19.825 --> 00:04:21.861
[ Normal voice ] Ivanka Trump
is set to testify tomorrow

00:04:21.861 --> 00:04:24.998
as part of the civil fraud trial
against former president Trump,

00:04:24.998 --> 00:04:26.966
marking -- making it, excuse me,

00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:29.268
the first thing she's been
invited to in New York

00:04:29.268 --> 00:04:30.737
in eight years.

00:04:30.737 --> 00:04:32.071
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.071 --> 00:04:35.707
Democrats -- Have her
over to your house.

00:04:35.707 --> 00:04:36.775
Feel so bad about it.

00:04:36.775 --> 00:04:38.677
Democrats reportedly
have concerns

00:04:38.677 --> 00:04:40.813
about President Biden's
reelection campaign

00:04:40.813 --> 00:04:42.648
and are worried that
his political advisers

00:04:42.648 --> 00:04:44.984
are ignoring warning signs
of sinking support.

00:04:44.984 --> 00:04:49.555
Said Biden, "There's nothing
to worry about, right, Jill?

00:04:49.555 --> 00:04:51.624
Jill?!"

00:04:51.624 --> 00:04:54.326
Amid reports that he has
declined an invitation

00:04:54.326 --> 00:04:56.762
to attend King Charles's
75th birthday party,

00:04:56.762 --> 00:04:58.664
a spokesperson for Prince Harry

00:04:58.664 --> 00:05:00.600
said that he never
received an invite,

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:03.870
or, more likely,
Meghan got the mail that day.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:06.139
[ Laughter ]

00:05:09.075 --> 00:05:10.309
Guys, let me tell you something.

00:05:10.309 --> 00:05:11.811
I don't think either
of them get the mail.

00:05:11.811 --> 00:05:14.447
[ Laughter ]

00:05:14.447 --> 00:05:17.115
Elon Musk's brain implant
company, Neuralink,

00:05:17.115 --> 00:05:18.951
has announced that
it's looking for volunteers

00:05:18.951 --> 00:05:20.319
for human testing.

00:05:20.319 --> 00:05:23.089
Well, actually, what they said
was "fresh volunteers."

00:05:23.089 --> 00:05:25.324
[ Laughter ]

00:05:25.324 --> 00:05:27.860
That's right,
Musk's brain implant company

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.563
has announced it's looking for
volunteers for human testing.

00:05:30.563 --> 00:05:32.165
I don't think he should be
meddling with something

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:34.634
he doesn't really understand,
like humans.

00:05:34.634 --> 00:05:36.769
[ Laughter ]

00:05:36.769 --> 00:05:38.905
The co-work--
I love what he did with Twitter.

00:05:38.905 --> 00:05:40.940
I'd love to get him
up in my brain.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.408
[ Laughter ]

00:05:42.408 --> 00:05:46.245
Love to get him up there
to fiddle around.

00:05:46.245 --> 00:05:47.513
Now it's not called
the brain anymore.

00:05:47.513 --> 00:05:48.748
It's called B.

00:05:48.748 --> 00:05:51.750
[ Laughter ]

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.219
The co-working space
company WeWork

00:05:54.219 --> 00:05:55.655
filed yesterday for bankruptcy.

00:05:55.655 --> 00:05:58.423
Wait a minute.
Again?

00:05:58.423 --> 00:05:59.959
You already went
out of business.

00:05:59.959 --> 00:06:01.627
I watched a whole miniseries

00:06:01.627 --> 00:06:03.729
about how you went
out of business,

00:06:03.729 --> 00:06:05.330
and you were still in business?

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:09.435
Oh, my God, Trump's going to win
again, isn't he?

00:06:09.435 --> 00:06:11.604
According to a new study,
daily marijuana use

00:06:11.604 --> 00:06:13.239
could increase the risk
of a heart attack.

00:06:13.239 --> 00:06:16.042
And that's why I only
smoke it nightly.

00:06:16.042 --> 00:06:17.977
[ Laughter ]

00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:21.948
Using my B.

00:06:23.816 --> 00:06:26.318
The CDC announced yesterday
it will expand

00:06:26.318 --> 00:06:28.387
its airport disease
surveillance program

00:06:28.387 --> 00:06:30.155
to include
more than 30 pathogens.

00:06:30.155 --> 00:06:33.559
Cool. I think I know where
you can find 27 of them.

00:06:33.559 --> 00:06:35.828
[ Audience groans ]

00:06:38.898 --> 00:06:41.400
The makers --
You guys all got feet.

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:43.503
[ Laughter ]

00:06:43.503 --> 00:06:46.371
Everybody's like, "Oh, feet,
a human foot.

00:06:46.371 --> 00:06:48.140
I would never."

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:49.875
The makers of M&amp;M's
have unveiled

00:06:49.875 --> 00:06:51.744
a new holiday flavor,
Toasty Vanilla,

00:06:51.744 --> 00:06:53.412
which features
white chocolate candies

00:06:53.412 --> 00:06:55.381
coated in brown,
white, and vanilla shell.

00:06:55.381 --> 00:06:57.616
It's the holiday treat
that will have everyone saying,

00:06:57.616 --> 00:06:59.719
"Do you have any normal ones?"

00:06:59.719 --> 00:07:01.788
[ Laughter ]

00:07:04.256 --> 00:07:05.958
And finally, according
to the latest numbers,

00:07:05.958 --> 00:07:09.061
Taylor Swift's new album
"1989 (Taylor's Version)"

00:07:09.061 --> 00:07:12.631
has sold 1.6 million units
in the U.S.,

00:07:12.631 --> 00:07:16.168
and it's made her
almost 8 cents on Spotify.

00:07:16.168 --> 00:07:18.037
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:18.037 --> 00:07:19.305
According to a new poll,

00:07:19.305 --> 00:07:23.075
President Biden's approval
rating dropped to 39%.

00:07:23.075 --> 00:07:24.977
But he's thinking
he can get that back up

00:07:24.977 --> 00:07:28.714
once he's indicted a few times.

00:07:28.714 --> 00:07:30.483
President Biden participated

00:07:30.483 --> 00:07:32.284
in yesterday's
White House Demo Day,

00:07:32.284 --> 00:07:35.120
showcasing new technologies
from across the country,

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:38.157
and was way
too easily impressed.

00:07:38.157 --> 00:07:43.095
"Sir,
that's the office printer."

00:07:43.095 --> 00:07:45.998
"Look at this thing."

00:07:45.998 --> 00:07:48.166
Former President Trump
praised his daughter Ivanka

00:07:48.166 --> 00:07:49.501
this morning ahead of her

00:07:49.501 --> 00:07:51.904
taking the witness stand
at his civil fraud trial

00:07:51.904 --> 00:07:54.173
and called her, "my wonderful
and beautiful daughter."

00:07:54.173 --> 00:07:55.908
Weird,
when his sons were testifying,

00:07:55.908 --> 00:07:57.777
he didn't have much
to say about them,

00:07:57.777 --> 00:07:59.612
but now that it's Ivanka,
he's talking to her

00:07:59.612 --> 00:08:03.015
like she has medical power
of attorney over him.

00:08:03.015 --> 00:08:04.483
"My wonderful
and beautiful daughter

00:08:04.483 --> 00:08:06.852
would never pull the plug
on her sick father.

00:08:06.852 --> 00:08:08.354
I could recover.

00:08:08.354 --> 00:08:11.991
A lot of people
are saying I could recover."

00:08:11.991 --> 00:08:13.826
Ahead of Ivanka Trump's
testimony today,

00:08:13.826 --> 00:08:16.094
former President Trump
complained in a post

00:08:16.094 --> 00:08:18.831
on Truth Social that the judge
and state prosecutors

00:08:18.831 --> 00:08:21.233
were, "making me look bad."

00:08:21.233 --> 00:08:23.035
And then he sprayed
his face bronze,

00:08:23.035 --> 00:08:25.337
combed his ear hair
to the center of his head,

00:08:25.337 --> 00:08:27.139
yanked his tie down
to his knees,

00:08:27.139 --> 00:08:30.609
and left the house for the day.

00:08:30.609 --> 00:08:32.044
During a hearing yesterday

00:08:32.044 --> 00:08:34.947
of the UK's official
coronavirus inquiry,

00:08:34.947 --> 00:08:36.248
a former aide said

00:08:36.248 --> 00:08:38.183
that then-Prime Minister
Boris Johnson

00:08:38.183 --> 00:08:39.952
had asked at the start
of the pandemic

00:08:39.952 --> 00:08:43.522
to be injected with Covid-19
live on television.

00:08:43.522 --> 00:08:45.624
Way too risky,
said his advisers,

00:08:45.624 --> 00:08:49.395
about putting him
live on television.

00:08:49.395 --> 00:08:53.866
The Boris Johnson photo
just getting laughs.

00:08:53.866 --> 00:08:55.234
Just getting laughs.

00:08:55.234 --> 00:08:56.835
It's good every now
and then when you go,

00:08:56.835 --> 00:08:59.938
"Yeah, we're not the only one
who had one of those."

00:08:59.938 --> 00:09:03.742
They had -- Other people
had one of those.

00:09:03.742 --> 00:09:05.911
Texas Senator Ted Cruz
said in a new interview

00:09:05.911 --> 00:09:08.213
that he plans to run
for president again someday

00:09:08.213 --> 00:09:11.216
and added, "I loved
running for president in 2016.

00:09:11.216 --> 00:09:12.751
We came incredibly close.

00:09:12.751 --> 00:09:14.453
We came within inches
of winning."

00:09:14.453 --> 00:09:16.489
I guess in the same way
that the moon

00:09:16.489 --> 00:09:20.792
is within 16 billion inches
of the Earth.

00:09:20.792 --> 00:09:23.495
Texas Senator Ted Cruz released
his new book yesterday titled,

00:09:23.495 --> 00:09:27.166
"Unwoke" How to Defeat
Cultural Marxism in America."

00:09:27.166 --> 00:09:28.534
And if you really want
to be unwoke,

00:09:28.534 --> 00:09:31.270
he also reads the audiobook.

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:35.073
[ Laughter ]

00:09:35.073 --> 00:09:36.609
New York Mets owner Steve Cohen

00:09:36.609 --> 00:09:39.011
yesterday unveiled his plans
for a new casino,

00:09:39.011 --> 00:09:41.480
hotel, and music venue
near Citi Field,

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:43.882
which is expected
to cost $8 billion,

00:09:43.882 --> 00:09:46.552
or roughly $1 billion
times as much as

00:09:46.552 --> 00:09:48.887
the average Mets ticket
in September.

00:09:48.887 --> 00:09:52.892
So much math in that joke.

00:09:52.892 --> 00:09:57.730
Not just math,
but then calendar.

00:09:57.730 --> 00:09:59.665
To get that punch line,
you had to do math,

00:09:59.665 --> 00:10:04.570
then you had to do calendar,
then you had to do baseball.

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:07.973
I can't believe it went
as well as it did.

00:10:07.973 --> 00:10:09.574
"People" magazine
announced yesterday

00:10:09.574 --> 00:10:11.876
that it has named actor
Patrick Dempsey

00:10:11.876 --> 00:10:13.345
The Sexiest Man Alive.

00:10:13.345 --> 00:10:14.747
[ Cheers ]

00:10:14.747 --> 00:10:17.249
You guys know we were
only supposed to set our clocks

00:10:17.249 --> 00:10:19.318
back one hour, right?

00:10:25.591 --> 00:10:28.060
I will say,
I read that joke first,

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:30.295
and then I saw a picture
and I'm like,

00:10:30.295 --> 00:10:33.499
"Pretty [bleep] sexy."

00:10:33.499 --> 00:10:36.268
I'm not complaining
about the pick.

00:10:36.268 --> 00:10:39.905
And finally, three pandas from
the Smithsonian National Zoo

00:10:39.905 --> 00:10:41.207
were returned to China today,

00:10:41.207 --> 00:10:43.843
packed in a special crate
on a FedEx plane --

00:10:43.843 --> 00:10:47.780
or as Southwest calls it,
Economy Plus.

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:50.682
President Biden and
Chinese President Xi Jinping

00:10:50.682 --> 00:10:52.451
are reportedly
prepared to announce

00:10:52.451 --> 00:10:55.454
the return of
the direct military hotline.

00:10:55.454 --> 00:10:56.588
And this is fun --

00:10:56.588 --> 00:11:01.259
they're letting
Biden pick the phone.

00:11:01.259 --> 00:11:03.095
The third Republican
presidential debate

00:11:03.095 --> 00:11:04.596
was held last night in Miami.

00:11:04.596 --> 00:11:05.898
What's the point?

00:11:05.898 --> 00:11:08.700
It's like going to a NSync
concert without Justin.

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:13.371
We don't know the rest of you!

00:11:13.371 --> 00:11:15.441
During the first few minutes
of last night's debate,

00:11:15.441 --> 00:11:17.676
moderator Lester Holt
admonished the crowd

00:11:17.676 --> 00:11:19.612
several times for
cheering and applauding,

00:11:19.612 --> 00:11:22.247
saying, "Let's not do this."

00:11:22.247 --> 00:11:24.750
Man, you know our political
decorum is in bad shape

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:26.418
when the moderator has to
talk to the audience

00:11:26.418 --> 00:11:28.954
like they're his ex-wife.

00:11:28.954 --> 00:11:30.990
"Can we not do this today,
Bethany?

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:34.827
I'm just here
to drop off the kids."

00:11:34.827 --> 00:11:38.130
During last night's debate,
Vivek Ramaswamy criticized

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:39.865
Nikki Haley's
foreign policy views

00:11:39.865 --> 00:11:43.034
and said she was,
"Dick Cheney in 3-inch heels."

00:11:43.034 --> 00:11:48.006
"Hey, I'm right here,"
said Ron DeSantis.

00:11:48.006 --> 00:11:51.643
After Vivek Ramaswamy criticized
Nikki Haley's daughter for using

00:11:51.643 --> 00:11:53.045
TikTok during
last night's debate,

00:11:53.045 --> 00:11:54.813
Haley told Ramaswamy to,

00:11:54.813 --> 00:11:56.916
"Keep my daughter's name
out of your voice."

00:11:56.916 --> 00:11:59.185
And even though he was
thousands of miles away,

00:11:59.185 --> 00:12:01.754
Chris Rock instinctively ducked.

00:12:04.857 --> 00:12:07.159
During last night's debate,
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis

00:12:07.159 --> 00:12:08.660
said that voters
shouldn't support

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:10.996
former President Trump in 2024,

00:12:10.996 --> 00:12:14.366
and added that he's a "different
guy than he was in 2016."

00:12:14.366 --> 00:12:15.534
Of course, thanks to Trump,

00:12:15.534 --> 00:12:21.841
we're all different guys
than we were in 2016.

00:12:21.841 --> 00:12:23.242
"Politico"
published an article today

00:12:23.242 --> 00:12:24.676
after last night's
debate titled,

00:12:24.676 --> 00:12:27.146
"Tim Scott's Girlfriend
is in fact, Real.

00:12:27.146 --> 00:12:32.017
However, Jury's Still Out
on Tim Scott."

00:12:32.017 --> 00:12:33.618
According to a new report,
the quality of the

00:12:33.618 --> 00:12:36.488
in-flight food onboard
Air Force Two has improved.

00:12:36.488 --> 00:12:39.858
Oh, you mean
since Mike Pence used it?

00:12:39.858 --> 00:12:43.228
The guy who thinks
oregano is a sin?

00:12:43.228 --> 00:12:44.797
He threw away the beverage cart

00:12:44.797 --> 00:12:48.166
when that Sprite
gave him a hangover.

00:12:48.166 --> 00:12:50.435
The FBI and Italian authorities
announced yesterday

00:12:50.435 --> 00:12:52.470
they arrested 17 men
allegedly connected

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:54.339
with the Gambino crime family
on charges

00:12:54.339 --> 00:12:56.608
including mafia association
and arson,

00:12:56.608 --> 00:12:58.677
though officials say
it could still be weeks

00:12:58.677 --> 00:13:03.548
before Netflix is able to
release a show about it.

00:13:03.548 --> 00:13:07.252
A bear in Florida recently stole
a $45 Taco Bell order

00:13:07.252 --> 00:13:09.621
from the front porch of a home.

00:13:09.621 --> 00:13:10.689
Wait a minute.

00:13:10.689 --> 00:13:14.726
How do you spend $45
at Taco Bell?

00:13:14.726 --> 00:13:18.864
What did you order?
All of it?

00:13:18.864 --> 00:13:21.166
And finally, the FDA
has launched an investigation

00:13:21.166 --> 00:13:24.636
into counterfeit versions
of the weight loss drug Ozempic.

00:13:24.636 --> 00:13:28.340
Users first became suspicious
when they noticed Wilma.

00:13:34.079 --> 00:13:35.914
That was a monologue,
everybody!

00:13:35.914 --> 00:13:41.086 line:0%
♪♪

